00:17:33.977 --> 00:17:36.380
What a joke. We'll clean them up all at once.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:37.881
They look kinda tough...

00:17:37.881 --> 00:17:39.405
Don't let your guard down, Sasha.

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:40.717
Get them!

00:17:40.717 --> 00:17:42.185
Detox!
Get them!

00:17:42.185 --> 00:17:44.988
Pieces of garbage who use soma
for personal greed!

00:17:44.988 --> 00:17:47.457
Unpleasant. This is REALLY unpleasant!

00:17:47.457 --> 00:17:48.583
Here we go, Mafuyu.

00:17:51.395 --> 00:17:52.089
Hana!

00:18:01.505 --> 00:18:03.507
Tremble! Kneel in fear!

00:18:03.507 --> 00:18:06.271
Taste well the queen's melancholy!

00:18:16.486 --> 00:18:18.155
I-Impossible!

00:18:18.155 --> 00:18:20.390
Weak. Too weak.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:22.722
This doesn't even count as a "warm-up."

00:18:25.896 --> 00:18:31.732
I see you lined up nothing but useless
Qwasers with atomic numbers in the 100s.

00:18:32.102 --> 00:18:36.664
If you want to drink soma that badly,
I'll let you have as much as you want.

00:18:37.107 --> 00:18:39.234
Go ahead. Suck!

00:18:40.277 --> 00:18:42.541
Suck! You WILL suck!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.211
Hya!

00:18:48.718 --> 00:18:53.314
No matter how much financial help you give,
a pissant's still a pissant, huh?

00:19:01.098 --> 00:19:03.430
Ah, Miss Katja!

00:19:05.969 --> 00:19:07.368
Th-There!

00:19:10.107 --> 00:19:12.442
I-I won't give in to temptation!

00:19:12.442 --> 00:19:15.002
I will NOT become your slave!

00:19:25.989 --> 00:19:27.251
Sorry for the bother!

00:19:28.258 --> 00:19:31.193
So then, Ayame... What's with this outfit?

00:19:42.606 --> 00:19:46.064
Don't look! I take it back, LOOK!

00:19:47.677 --> 00:19:49.946
I know, Ayame.

00:19:49.946 --> 00:19:53.313
That's your own, personal outfit
you bought off the internet, isn't it?

00:19:58.622 --> 00:20:01.750
100% percent natural free-flowing springs!

00:20:02.425 --> 00:20:07.624
You're frightened of the moment your
internal sense of virtue will crumble.

00:20:08.965 --> 00:20:10.100
I...

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:13.637
When that happens,
instincts overtake reason.

00:20:13.637 --> 00:20:15.939
An immoral animal!

00:20:15.939 --> 00:20:17.065
Instincts?

00:20:17.774 --> 00:20:22.438
Above all, you will accept that you
are a pee slave, nothing more.

00:20:27.017 --> 00:20:32.819
Pee slave... Pee slave... Pee slave...

00:20:41.198 --> 00:20:42.790
Welcome!

00:20:45.535 --> 00:20:48.800
I'm being strung up higher than usual!

00:20:53.476 --> 00:20:55.603
Miss Katja!

00:20:59.182 --> 00:21:01.685
This is going to be a long night.

00:21:01.685 --> 00:21:05.314
Miss Katja!

00:21:26.509 --> 00:21:32.916
Unstable, an asymmetrical trajectory

00:21:32.916 --> 00:21:39.422
Irises shaded in prelude

00:21:39.422 --> 00:21:45.695
The light's terminal line remains distorted

00:21:45.695 --> 00:21:51.258
And deceives the visualized dream

00:21:53.136 --> 00:21:58.541
In that dark, fictional abyss

00:21:58.541 --> 00:22:04.614
Someday, smash through the imprisoned world

00:22:04.614 --> 00:22:06.583
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:06.583 --> 00:22:08.251
And you will die in your sin

00:22:08.251 --> 00:22:11.454
Slice the cross, is the voice that recites

00:22:11.454 --> 00:22:15.091
A poem of awakening to an absent god

00:22:15.091 --> 00:22:17.927
The blade of sacrilege?

00:22:17.927 --> 00:22:19.496
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:19.496 --> 00:22:21.164
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:21.164 --> 00:22:24.934
An oratorio with you, who have been cut off

00:22:24.934 --> 00:22:27.804
Sorrow is illuminated by the moon

00:22:27.804 --> 00:22:33.401
An eve that leads to a sparkling blue tomorrow

00:23:01.371 --> 00:23:03.601
The Noah of Gold...

00:23:05.175 --> 00:23:08.474
That's where it was hiding, eh?

00:23:10.046 --> 00:23:11.047
Next Episode

00:23:11.047 --> 00:23:13.149
The Divine Punishment
Enforcement Unit, Meteora...

00:23:13.149 --> 00:23:16.815
That dangerous military unit has finally
mobilized in search of the Noah of Gold.

00:23:17.554 --> 00:23:20.123
The peace of these days was an illusion.

00:23:20.123 --> 00:23:24.321
That transient time is finished, and the time
will again come for the Qwasers to fight!

00:23:25.328 --> 00:23:26.663
Next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,

00:23:26.663 --> 00:23:31.668
Peace Ends, and the
Cogs of Destiny Begin to Turn

00:23:31.668 --> 00:23:34.637
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!
